111	// With no write failure the idle declaration emits every window its new
112	// effective watermark closes: contributions from both partitions stay merged
113	// per key and window, ordering is end ascending then key in UTF-8 byte
114	// order, and the declaration itself adds no extra record. The still-open
115	// [1200,2200) window is not flushed at end of input.
